#: scenario3:scenario3_B22C54AE_13D7_4EF6_98DD_84AB3228666B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afbe32527d68b137780ab0baa87d9a4e996cdc17deb20a5df43f4bd82aa050ab
#. default-sha256: f754974231abb4ee798d527696f3c5215f5b8e58cbea29d5247e8ffedc1d9e44
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B22C54AE_13D7_4EF6_98DD_84AB3228666B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Master. ⟪k:4⟫Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……주인님, ⟪k:4⟫주인님."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2FCCFDD8_433A_4294_9CB6_5C7C35CDD92C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eef709190e26557639c02b774a2fc8b08f0b8ce950231557f23f7cea8c945ba2
#. default-sha256: 9c794beabce1b97713cd3b063f4cb56ae4a88b84c4d21c0589984053b33d2db3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2FCCFDD8_433A_4294_9CB6_5C7C35CDD92C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you shocked?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or do you instead lament this development?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫놀라셨는지요? ⟪k:1⟫아니면 ⟪k:2⟫탄식이 나오시는지요?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1EFB07A8_8D5D_4CCA_9EFD_23CE0ACEAA07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c9a3dafd84305ea02ac70535d4192f8c39de7399869f227c6522a6898c05cc9
#. default-sha256: ba4034eb64811566cec87508941e3a30a85e85ed3dded9f721f24f30c11a09ed
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1EFB07A8_8D5D_4CCA_9EFD_23CE0ACEAA07"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was... ⟪k:1⟫I was deeply sorrowful.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Though to a lesser degree about Maria’s true "
"intentions and more my shameful inability to recognize her machinations."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저는, ⟪k:1⟫그렇지요……. ⟪k:2⟫매우 슬펐답니다. ⟪k:3⟫마리아의 속내 자체보단 ⟪k:4⟫그걸 모르던 제 "
"한심함에 ⟪k:5⟫말이지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_69DB4C0C_31D8_4AFE_B6DE_D91912124EB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61d65acb814b5ff14c66809470264b12e4c1a6c6e6583d560658541e45eba06a
#. default-sha256: 0d6b9b446f53498d109601ccb170964674f6d04f0cf3db3eb7ad8adf4162563a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_69DB4C0C_31D8_4AFE_B6DE_D91912124EB6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫At the time, I too believed that Maria was the White-Haired Girl’s one and only ally."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 당시의 저는 ⟪k:1⟫마리아가 ⟪k:2⟫백발 소녀의 유일한 아군일 거라 믿었거든요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A420E2B1_D973_4284_8769_540A95782AF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 058fd42bfb8f9e5b3bbce08f0f501f0f882061a2302fb3805941c0dbee43ec7d
#. default-sha256: 06d772d85c41fc8760510d126c3e0fb0c743ad678809db69aa8d207853f2f801
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A420E2B1_D973_4284_8769_540A95782AF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not until everything had drawn to a close that I discovered the truth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 진상을 안 건 ⟪k:1⟫모든 게 ⟪k:2⟫끝난 후였습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0FBCF4C5_58AC_40A3_9903_30F2EEDD78E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aca78f606e64f85eacd37c3a1c5b1825c2745e917002be18b1b6e5fb27de5151
#. default-sha256: f589e1df2ba31ac3e428482cf951beeda5bf6f94ba03641051fa029e7f93c2ba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0FBCF4C5_58AC_40A3_9903_30F2EEDD78E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Then I now know how the tale ends, you say? ⟪k:1⟫Yes, that is correct."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……그렇다면 ⟪k:1⟫지금은 ⟪k:2⟫결말까지 아는 것 아니냐고요?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫네, ⟪k:5⟫맞습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BEED55E5_FC2D_4478_B59E_1B24A3621BE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a8f7c11bc563ae6446b1f61e2f19425914d9265b9bbdb51616dfc7fe3a37cf3
#. default-sha256: c4aea077c3c09ccf16f8fe8c92cc6da2197c9ab28238317dc201b4d300061f80
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BEED55E5_FC2D_4478_B59E_1B24A3621BE8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Well aware that it was not the case, I told you the story in a way that suggested she ⟪k:1⟫"
"was⟪k:2⟫ on the White-Haired Girl’s side."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 모든 걸 알면서 ⟪k:1⟫마리아가 소녀 편인 것처럼 이야기했습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_037D8825_28AD_45EC_B463_30A9229BB447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38d6a4e0e0048501421cc0a9176988fb505256366e271eb4d7fb6b10ba91ff3c
#. default-sha256: c4a353931469fddee97fc37cd07e0373bc9bab01f982280a3ecc8c80b3682e7a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_037D8825_28AD_45EC_B463_30A9229BB447"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh my... ⟪k:1⟫I wonder if that constitutes lying to you, Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머……, ⟪k:1⟫이건 ⟪k:2⟫주인님께 거짓말을 한 게 될지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_536BA22B_D9AB_4269_98F1_CF7925EE61BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5813a7a61aaceb4abc52ad7d1750b3c61266fbdda0b9a72d49ce25e0562f9ff9
#. default-sha256: 315d9982af8864edee2fd37d970ae1baa80b955373b4151de2ee59f9985c27e4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_536BA22B_D9AB_4269_98F1_CF7925EE61BA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I merely wanted to present the events to you in order, starting from the beginning, when "
"Maria’s ill intentions were still veiled in shadow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 저는 ⟪k:1⟫순서대로 ⟪k:2⟫모든 걸 전해 드리고 싶었습니다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫마리아의 악의를 모르"
"던 때부터 ⟪k:5⟫차근차근."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B07B1C5C_AD18_48B5_9A1C_9188D3B65528
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3ef628b46206e15a5d431b960a56c2d67e436fb4d034faaf4f44ddc1cfe8838
#. default-sha256: 58f6a5ece7794c7ac57271e2454e5cf9b20122b683766ac1ec5ae9c02ce18230
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B07B1C5C_AD18_48B5_9A1C_9188D3B65528"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted you to know the same feeling of consternation I had experienced."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제 경악을…… 슬픔을.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫주인님께서도 ⟪k:3⟫알아 주시길 바랐습니다……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E9E59592_BFFD_4854_A962_ECEE24240B56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5d40c219aa96a74ec3591abbc75c7ba2390dd4290ec9cd69c6517ff45c7b0fd
#. default-sha256: acb7c1ccd1b25b703355663e1964865095c43350e4f24e096adbacc26b9a9dc0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E9E59592_BFFD_4854_A962_ECEE24240B56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫The White-Haired Girl continued to write letter "
"after letter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫백발 소녀는 ⟪k:10⟫그 후로도 꾸준히 편지를 썼습니"
"다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F1FC3C19_29B2_4F4C_836F_C0D34DD55451
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf6705739bf01f23a3113c258b4a5c2efbe7f8a4560fca0c23631e96fc8e4c5c
#. default-sha256: f2988c90528bd83779db7642faee2926294c330c61cae755be5b2b87d21fe18d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F1FC3C19_29B2_4F4C_836F_C0D34DD55451"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They were all addressed to her dear husband, detailing her ever-persistent love for him..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫받는 이 부분에 ⟪k:1⟫사랑하는 남편의 이름을 적고,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫자신이 아직 ⟪k:4⟫예전처럼 사랑한단 "
"사실을."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8FD88E68_AF08_459F_BEA4_43220459FE5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72077312408a36a4473bbbdb404ebd20b845dc96ff6ee5e1bc9f3500937c3a3a
#. default-sha256: 02f3b2586fb6045ec00c8512722937b116445256a5554fe0f6842d537c623768
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8FD88E68_AF08_459F_BEA4_43220459FE5D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and her desire for their relationship to return to what it had once been."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫예전 같은 관계로 돌아가고 싶단 내용을 ⟪k:1⟫적었습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7332670A_DF5B_43B9_8DC2_C59C37EC2896
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5e1e136d5d03a5127e6162928c9e423e0f3ed56cd0b59a7bccacc6bc2da6990
#. default-sha256: d807d7fb4a87e74cc2a7467f8231a33a80d3fec02eafbe9c4765912b71453f45
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7332670A_DF5B_43B9_8DC2_C59C37EC2896"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My beloved,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I am sure your hands are quite full right now.⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사랑하는 당신. ⟪k:1⟫당신은 지금⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫눈앞의 사업에 한창 바쁘시겠죠."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7377A6CF_B0F7_4CE8_9A1E_B62F992FB17E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa203f9ff307b45060b586d0206b1e044589edf15d841e9e8ef7c78b029a59c8
#. default-sha256: c4f68bb86a73c931e4f801df71d4577ea5e1bc2af5d984ef6352cceafcf5f264
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7377A6CF_B0F7_4CE8_9A1E_B62F992FB17E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But that is fine; it does not change my love for you.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 그래도 돼요. ⟪k:1⟫그래도 당신을 사랑해요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6C01F95_238D_42FB_8CEB_21E1ACDEB556
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be6e58127ba8a34100e8ac73350e44e163203db85f0a18697475b73a9401765e
#. default-sha256: a65efb06951cabd293cec3bcedb4ebe09f83ff8f8e5268d5ad3ccfa3826796cb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6C01F95_238D_42FB_8CEB_21E1ACDEB556"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you remember the day we went out together?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That was, perhaps, the most "
"wonderful day of my life.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I had a truly incredible time.⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫함께 외출한 날을 ⟪k:1⟫기억하시나요? ⟪k:2⟫저는 ⟪k:3⟫그때 진심으로⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫즐거웠어요. ⟪k:6⟫인"
"생에서 가장 좋은 날이었어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F3789E13_79DE_4518_A353_0ECBAA53CEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59ba6266bdb112f7ec425e76f51ee94dd0a24d0ecb5b7f2188b419273583de38
#. default-sha256: c45818c2289441b8b024205ed3c91e01a51574ce2f9106793583ec1351542c94
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F3789E13_79DE_4518_A353_0ECBAA53CEF0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I still treasure the gift you gave to me,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫for it is the one and only present I "
"have received from you...⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫당신에게 받은 보물도 ⟪k:1⟫소중히 하고 있어요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그건 ⟪k:4⟫당신에게 받은 유일한 선물이"
"니까요……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_078A285C_DB66_4D08_A856_7F85CABAF5BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4e37efb357a90d8efe48d1d388c95f526308d876e8512426150457dd6362f3a
#. default-sha256: df6ee8a43b5d835cc9769db540a65747270c4707c7d425257172beb86d85b2ac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_078A285C_DB66_4D08_A856_7F85CABAF5BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That reminds me, Maria tried to teach me how to dance.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I doubt I will ever "
"progress beyond being laughably bad, though...⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그러고 보니―― ⟪k:1⟫마리아가 댄스를 가르쳐 주었어요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫제 댄스는 ⟪k:4⟫아직 우스운 수준"
"이겠지만……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E062BEDC_9AE6_477E_9EAB_2F776BA9919A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9826b1947ba8bb66cdf551772deb38aea4bca260d1e42051991587f37fca8a2a
#. default-sha256: cda5d800259888897f2aad22f7a6b90eabe055f1502f7c77e26d550ac141cadc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E062BEDC_9AE6_477E_9EAB_2F776BA9919A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It would be nice if, someday, you and I could dance together.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫언젠가 ⟪k:1⟫당신하고도 ⟪k:2⟫댄스를 추면 기쁘겠어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_26F96882_6E8B_4C97_88BF_D48D97982A92
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f8bb1fdae5146433ffd2068126e8a5131f492dd4e1712c85b13592cd71ea0ac
#. default-sha256: b470d91a6e6062ca35a4c063f6d9f8b7b3fd3621d79c57e387c92056eec739b8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_26F96882_6E8B_4C97_88BF_D48D97982A92"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perhaps, when you have a little respite from work, we could go out again, maybe take a "
"carriage somewhere a little farther away.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫일이 일단락되면 ⟪k:1⟫또 ⟪k:2⟫함께 외출해 주시겠나요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫마차를 타고 ⟪k:5⟫살짝 멀리 나"
"가 보고 싶어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7D5F193_D18B_482C_9412_88BCDF5A0C93
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5d8746e0360c4f0dc85895a52c3289fe90574163c5b6125d5fe9d85f29bf325
#. default-sha256: d53566d0e731bba25902bda369796a76cf6d9de11681d0cfe671e1479d8de5f5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7D5F193_D18B_482C_9412_88BCDF5A0C93"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And we could dine at a restaurant more to your liking.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그때는 ⟪k:1⟫맛있는 레스토랑에 가요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_470CC718_B9D6_41CC_B704_B9206DFD8ED6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc568687f1559553b4893101000a8439c9fa3bbe0a2592f09a2e1391e8b461eb
#. default-sha256: cfc90468cc2ce61c415ca42721589d18ac2d9d938851e621b3b7bac9e5c7e000
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_470CC718_B9D6_41CC_B704_B9206DFD8ED6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Although, I think the cuisine at the other restaurant was exquisite, personally.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래도 ⟪k:1⟫저는…… ⟪k:2⟫당신과 함께 간 레스토랑의 맛도 ⟪k:3⟫좋게 느껴졌어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C35D0B18_64E9_408C_8AD3_1673B334D207
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86bd3b94dc3ea15a05058001a910a3d0d5f4303c2f1dd0ded33b1800ade991ce
#. default-sha256: 489b26e186f29558d51fedd158ab5d634eeee9e3cb62dd4f4516fe208d804c0c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C35D0B18_64E9_408C_8AD3_1673B334D207"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do I, perhaps, have an unrefined palate?⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫미각이 모자란 걸까요?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F55CE928_ED20_4637_8482_B36D44AB0A51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70f2a6487b7095218a0dba14b2c0a2b55275509005f8b1255e87ac161a879bfb
#. default-sha256: 2d6910dbea59e9ef1d85c085a5b1a358072fde93158df4f36be485bf2433ee63
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F55CE928_ED20_4637_8482_B36D44AB0A51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria altered the letters before delivering them, however.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She changed the "
"addressee from Jacopo to another man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫그 편지는 모두 ⟪k:2⟫마리아가 조작했습니다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫받는 이의 이름은 야코포가 아"
"닌 ⟪k:5⟫다른 사람으로."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6A9592E1_29C1_4FB4_885C_5B810929B83F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ab9ba415c31ca4643d01346f22dbff771e4ca62ffc824186486ee1a5983e397
#. default-sha256: b231b50d3d0d260e96fdf8cb1a3284051e498aa11b3e23063f71c425568e5f90
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6A9592E1_29C1_4FB4_885C_5B810929B83F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She would cut away the top of the page with Jacopo’s name on it, and in the space below "
"write a different name."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫마리아는 ⟪k:1⟫편지지 윗줄에 적힌 야코포의 이름을 잘라 내고――,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 밑줄에 다른 사람의 "
"이름을 적은 겁니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AFBC8CD9_BD05_4D83_868A_BE1F230C0838
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d087ae2857c4eff2e962b80eb6256edb4b55c8392a9750ce9b7a8b56d481072a
#. default-sha256: 4cc67cd3e8e07f1a4747ba64cfe51c4a03be9945c79df07ef40af43388d63f6a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AFBC8CD9_BD05_4D83_868A_BE1F230C0838"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She could not have mimicked the White-Haired Girl’s handwriting for the full length of a "
"letter, but Maria could make a single name look adequately similar."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫모든 문장의 필체를 따라하는 건 불가능하지만, ⟪k:1⟫받는 이만 바꾸는 거라면 어떻게든 되었지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_101EB0A4_AF89_43CD_B7F7_037D32EFC20E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b36722d0d780ca85dfa3c9508ce33d908ac1f716579cadf00010f8ce012e7c0a
#. default-sha256: 4fc75d070754c78042802ef7c4ea9bfc8f8aa947d9dbca1d96e2c735492e26e9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_101EB0A4_AF89_43CD_B7F7_037D32EFC20E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it would, after all, be quite difficult to notice minor discrepancies in such a small "
"quantity of text."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫더군다나 ⟪k:1⟫인명 하나 정도라면 ⟪k:2⟫필체가 조금 달라도 들키지 않았습니다……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BD12B27F_7A2B_4DBC_A3C2_7F4056F82166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c22e530963c4e9d67071d3082faee53b95ec44285cfac96b56d1d42a85ccf7ef
#. default-sha256: 85168bd5736f289a14f1800ed3a1a8dd2b10c5f62aeaba58617dd5bff31fdf6c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BD12B27F_7A2B_4DBC_A3C2_7F4056F82166"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Again... ⟪k:10⟫Another letter?!⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Why "
"does she keep writing these?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫또……, ⟪k:10⟫또 편지야……!⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫왜 이렇게 자"
"꾸 쓰는 건데……!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B5983E94_BBC9_45BF_B0FB_1B0C2E30EB64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea05753bbd23d4d35069283726512a5fcf676479f2afb015491bf907fa486944
#. default-sha256: ca43c997e8bcaeba630d9379a27d2aab211e463910560f6de8a2910aa848b819
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B5983E94_BBC9_45BF_B0FB_1B0C2E30EB64"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To Jacopo’s eyes, the modified letters looked like professions of love for another man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫받는 이가 바뀐 편지는 ⟪k:1⟫야코포가 보기에 「외간 남자에게 쓴 러브레터」로만 보였습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_62944463_45B4_447D_9941_303F4D8DC728
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b81bfe6a970f0e1c5227b93f4a8f976566aa432197263de5822776e7276b10c
#. default-sha256: 06ea11e3686421342df092a17d3be0419d61c6e92284ffc3abd74e16b33a7f4a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_62944463_45B4_447D_9941_303F4D8DC728"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more she inscribed of her feelings for Jacopo, the greater the turmoil grew within his "
"heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫백발 소녀가 ⟪k:1⟫편지지에 사랑을 쓸수록―― 야코포의 마음은 ⟪k:2⟫혼란에 빠졌습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAE71367_CD0B_413F_9F18_85D94107EED6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc214fa990b9a314597b46342c857a2c7c15642e8d733fc0a8d91ef7c7ea8a59
#. default-sha256: 5eda6c1cfd177426f7ecf1f2eeb88d103bd4f1bcf30ab544f4ea547fc9e10c20
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAE71367_CD0B_413F_9F18_85D94107EED6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Even though her love was directed toward him..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫실제로는 ⟪k:1⟫그 모든 사랑을 ⟪k:2⟫야코포에게 바친 것인데도요……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74677037_C960_434B_8799_3174A9E124B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9759cd399035b2a815b3792c035241e6df02987016803febc14c6045de8852d
#. default-sha256: 7a213dd66439ac995a6fc881676581d07e7966e2c9a865a08be6fed4594ff0e4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74677037_C960_434B_8799_3174A9E124B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I can’t— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can’t believe what I’m reading!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이딴――, ⟪k:1⟫이딴, ⟪k:2⟫이딴 편지를………!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B4D774AE_816B_411C_8AE3_D158DE11CA5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ab902b1c6b622371626da8bfc96807c60d6e59995584a74d0d001724ab1ed25
#. default-sha256: d5ebfc955bcc1dcffc391c9139066a29635056c22df9f9e2e934a763304e3026
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B4D774AE_816B_411C_8AE3_D158DE11CA5A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“A restaurant more to your liking”?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I knew it... ⟪k:3⟫you ⟪k:4⟫have⟪k:5⟫ been going "
"out with other men, all the while pretending to be chaste in my presence!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫레스토랑이라고――? ⟪k:1⟫너는 역시…… 내 앞에선 조신한 척하며―― 다른 남자와 외출한 건가……!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3D9BCC94_FF43_4603_8A0E_F8BE68EDDE4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0587ac95e847bcfdfc5178c986c2f3147ace7c65891f6b98647d8bb96f3b78c
#. default-sha256: 4c38b8923489c6af76235b2192dbdf6955b7ed070f943c39da2ce12645458456
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3D9BCC94_FF43_4603_8A0E_F8BE68EDDE4F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫“I still treasure the gift you gave to me”?!⟪k:1⟫God’s sake!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫보물은 무슨……! ⟪k:1⟫개같은………!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABA07F0C_F921_46EC_9909_A42142880D1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c01513dd691f0879758f9bae8b569d08856b9cf96611097c9e106684a7c3163c
#. default-sha256: aa5583dbad3600ad8d8deff87dab2f8be98450785336537a8978635ab9e554e4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABA07F0C_F921_46EC_9909_A42142880D1D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You have to be fucking kidding!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫웃기지 마………!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0232D285_6D4F_4DE2_961B_C1AE925083B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ca2ed045eb41694d706967d9b7f9d5aeec71bbcbec171c09691db9ec8a71351
#. default-sha256: 8dfbbf20859ce0e633fe53dac16789ce42a6dc22ecd4cc84e2084d8e52cc5134
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0232D285_6D4F_4DE2_961B_C1AE925083B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............Ngh."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………큭."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F166BBBD_C8BF_4057_99B4_957EBEB5174C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da28993aa5bd2527a71714d7a83cda12afb01c9df31dc1976fcb85484940725e
#. default-sha256: 6bb4664108b568c050e11a36f9d97edad624bd4fb34362d515b90e95f2143d12
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F166BBBD_C8BF_4057_99B4_957EBEB5174C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(But I’ve ensured she can’t leave that room!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She’ll never see this man again...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(하지만―― ⟪k:1⟫그 방에선 못 나오게 했어!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ 그 녀석이 ⟪k:4⟫이 남자와 다시 만날 일은……)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AA5D9DB1_02B7_4FB2_95D3_F96965EED929
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 966a7ea8c4b6de998bf8f8e814767655e228c741878ba66858969e392ee083a1
#. default-sha256: 8dfe6d8bab47b939a190fb423eaf6befebe060acb6b19df798b51050009c6aba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AA5D9DB1_02B7_4FB2_95D3_F96965EED929"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(In time, she’ll let go... ⟪k:1⟫and so will he...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(그 녀석은 조만간 포기할 거고…… 남자 쪽도 포기할 거야……)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_47ED758F_1A81_4DD6_9DFD_A30A6993178C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17b1c2027eee0663ef1f865312f9a63e2ced6982b5b0f757308186dc09fb0879
#. default-sha256: 22aab61393436e28c8927b18743ba32ca8c17c3ef1df98bf1d0c6f0f1c088a97
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_47ED758F_1A81_4DD6_9DFD_A30A6993178C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Ahh, listen to me.⟪k:1⟫Resigning myself to the hope that everything will fix itself...⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫How did I end up like this?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(아아――, ⟪k:1⟫나는 ⟪k:2⟫이토록 비굴한 생각이나 하는 남자였나……)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_055210D6_0009_4EA9_A188_FCC724C81A56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6278275d1a5fc2e976b1e068e3192ca38471ced448ac7ee907bd3b91d00d9286
#. default-sha256: 044391c84ddc9872aabee600d252aec49d2c9dbd69aba6aa65486476a703ef37
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_055210D6_0009_4EA9_A188_FCC724C81A56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Such a pitiful man I’ve become...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(……이렇게 ⟪k:1⟫비참하게……)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_194B39BC_4CE1_43B0_A750_4A51ED4D218C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91ea3ba172e75794cab47e1b4c779f9a57a36e83ab93bfe250e603672a2a854d
#. default-sha256: d0129ca7f23905785c644b2d6268dfd2afebbe8f63469f2696404aceffde54ee
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_194B39BC_4CE1_43B0_A750_4A51ED4D218C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫On the surface, Maria acted quite heartbroken at the sight of their suffering."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫마리아는 그런 둘을 보며 ⟪k:1⟫겉으로는 몹시 슬픈 시늉을 했으나――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7C58F6CE_3BB5_46D1_9D98_F170AA9E7258
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 130d49e89ea4ecf775c593a1d5bf1eaec5905254a29ccfd9aea37d37a6b913b9
#. default-sha256: 084d716e1c3477661909420b53d5ab5c8bd64857a2dd644d79221e465caf4c91
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7C58F6CE_3BB5_46D1_9D98_F170AA9E7258"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But when she returned to her room, the walls echoed with her cackles. ⟪k:1⟫She derived a "
"great deal of entertainment from their squirming."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫방에 돌아가면 ⟪k:1⟫깔깔 웃었습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫마리아에게 ⟪k:4⟫둘의 고뇌는 몹시 우스꽝스러웠을 "
"겁니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CB7A3857_AA78_4D07_B7B6_E02AE4675CD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebebf6daa0c6925113723b7c6251030bfe6d14af7217e6197f18ba59ca1c9fe1
#. default-sha256: 0246852452b7d388ddd0a41c9018ffbb3b23e1230b97950aacc529878700af66
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CB7A3857_AA78_4D07_B7B6_E02AE4675CD9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The more they writhed in anguish, the deeper her satisfaction grew."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫둘이 고통받을수록, ⟪k:1⟫고뇌할수록,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫마리아의 유열은 끝을 모르고 치솟았습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_830ADD04_45C1_4706_87D5_99FFB88E5EF6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62ff05bfb0209c7f62a6f067566c2d26759a03bf1b370ece92421c6a64f4a0a1
#. default-sha256: b4621f08a18c2b395021120f198ebdf45c826d81d6e802fb59da4249544e59ab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_830ADD04_45C1_4706_87D5_99FFB88E5EF6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And both the White-Haired Girl and Jacopo continued to place their "
"confidence in Maria—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫the one responsible for everything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫실상은 다 마리아 짓이건만, ⟪k:5⟫백발 소녀와 ⟪k:6⟫야코포는 ⟪k:7⟫마리아에"
"게 의존했습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F465F1A3_FC1C_4DF5_9EA5_6575686FE7B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8464b611faa3c5a4bf88aed20b2801c01d17a13b766b43c85c057061d2128c5b
#. default-sha256: 0d56a61b53d7c7babf9eb8a5f924a1f93b17bfb654f1cf7b58ee4dd09d9c982c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F465F1A3_FC1C_4DF5_9EA5_6575686FE7B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl had never possessed a sense of distrust, and so she took everything "
"Maria said as truth, continuing, in her agony, to write Jacopo letters."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫원래부터 남을 의심할 줄 모르던 백발 소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫마리아의 말을 곧이곧대로 믿어서―― 한탄하면서"
"도 ⟪k:2⟫포기하지 않고 편지를 썼습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8FB8FE28_CCF5_4335_A6FA_77687A0B1BD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a5295123f29ff3a56146c290c5869e6abab5a53610ba469fc5fd5d7de25d4a6
#. default-sha256: 909aa49df665ab2277d4e5c67f6d2510d91f14e74cc2e9a8a287e8901f3c3eee
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8FB8FE28_CCF5_4335_A6FA_77687A0B1BD2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Letter after letter after letter."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫몇 통이고, ⟪k:1⟫몇 통이고, ⟪k:2⟫몇 통이고."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A921A368_BDAE_4AF0_AB5C_C3B1B5926459
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f95fff34f2b6b2284b4d4c01285c5325693a96f7d42388d659d81fa4b97ad51
#. default-sha256: d9b4f5b00f33e2d5a7300a54a0ef97a396c347d5ce4f3d9a23c32c663543bc85
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A921A368_BDAE_4AF0_AB5C_C3B1B5926459"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My beloved,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are you still tied up with your work?⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사랑하는 당신. ⟪k:1⟫아직 일이 ⟪k:2⟫바쁘신가요?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9521FB25_384A_47B1_8307_A477AB4052A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee3914c8a125e9a4151e3258e8ab1ebe5bcd085f89dfb335ae7122eabf132be5
#. default-sha256: 68300c072dcaa53f48a0d465b026b21a825334b5d2caea72f2e68b46ddfed92b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9521FB25_384A_47B1_8307_A477AB4052A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It has been some time since we last saw one another,⟪k:2⟫so I know not what you have "
"been doing of late...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I only hope you remain in good health.⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫좀처럼 만나질 못 해서 ⟪k:1⟫당신이 지금 뭘 하시는지도 모르겠네요……. ⟪k:2⟫부디 ⟪k:3⟫건강하시면 "
"좋겠는데요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E3071CFB_0BED_4668_BDC2_71A89B9879D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f4f2f91c390c7097d5cd5900837a1ecb4c9a69362345cf38a6d6d551ef9afdd
#. default-sha256: c097953fdf0cea6306b7096832dcefdd90fa65690b3d98905646a62e39013d16
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E3071CFB_0BED_4668_BDC2_71A89B9879D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would, if possible, prefer to tell you everything in person, but I do not have the "
"courage, so these letters are my only option.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫실은 ⟪k:1⟫직접 만나서 ⟪k:2⟫많은 말씀을 드리고 싶어요. ⟪k:3⟫하지만 저는 그럴 용기가 없어서 "
"⟪k:4⟫이렇게 편지밖에 못 쓰죠."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FFEF22EE_0E20_4C8D_9732_3717FF8D9CA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5eab4060ab4b32e4e12ee5fe38eca368b6151a673633550e00df3d7a706523ee
#. default-sha256: 4f7b3ff146fc1c4555608640751316e6d6bbd38c024ae9b58b6581b5b248865a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FFEF22EE_0E20_4C8D_9732_3717FF8D9CA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Am I adequately expressing my feelings... ⟪k:2⟫my love for you?⟪k:3⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제 심정, ⟪k:1⟫제 마음이……. ⟪k:2⟫당신에게 ⟪k:3⟫잘 전해지고 있나요?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_311E889B_C458_4175_9E35_7AF167CCC76A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0813c7dc81e1f0fc6ab46082101b7d92ce3bf47f0a6475f3de3ec002f039e7d0
#. default-sha256: 89177a31f81e9be1a1d805184653793758df77ebdad69072024101a169eadd59
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_311E889B_C458_4175_9E35_7AF167CCC76A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If you have the time... ⟪k:2⟫I would appreciate a response.⟪k:3⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫가능하시다면…… 답장을 ⟪k:1⟫보내 주세요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_692E00B3_E384_46D3_A30D_8EA5420DE862
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c96c801508e746cd25cd74259783a32174e93b6caec72c7457061db14d05780c
#. default-sha256: 459e97e5f7098a8feebeed033fd5cedb6e74ab3e4b319d4c85447905b15c1d9b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_692E00B3_E384_46D3_A30D_8EA5420DE862"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...You’re never gonna get a response, though..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……답장이 ⟪k:5⟫올 리가 없잖아……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1D2BA10E_EF7F_4518_A2BF_1E9D90D2C4FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 544e1f568cf33cf2486875bd0ae1b42110484a71e3b94206eee8cb8193bfafa3
#. default-sha256: a5450dc4ba153f680952a5ffab8a2f082834ea8b3c277816d99235c04f56e80c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1D2BA10E_EF7F_4518_A2BF_1E9D90D2C4FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not as long as I’m intercepting them..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내가 ⟪k:1⟫이렇게―― 뺏어 보고 있으니……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B1DEBC2E_B042_4EE4_AE87_E0F97F180334
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1aa3817f5a8b8c79e1969dbc8a657911e47a68fd6e06d9a6db48455659aab403
#. default-sha256: 99963e4b4553484c4dea2e2163c59c8c3373169fec3ebfc11f61c6fc8938f759
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B1DEBC2E_B042_4EE4_AE87_E0F97F180334"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There’s no way I’m allowing these... ⟪k:1⟫or your love to get to him..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네 마음을…… 닿게 할 수는 없단 말이야……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B8D9A232_A82E_4FCB_9E99_4DEDD49A4E39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5a9f9ea85a32a94fe4c3cfe485c71f162d43cfb66354109edafabd83dabb4a9
#. default-sha256: b670d4487deb98b9209185c8f27b962429a82e80c4d3a765a48e17eec44a098d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B8D9A232_A82E_4FCB_9E99_4DEDD49A4E39"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I could just stop reading them.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(차라리 ⟪k:1⟫이런 걸 안 보면――)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_004E5DF0_9EA6_4EB6_858D_55E1C7416E27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c56abcfee9e84ea7f278c0dce33589d687dfc965aaf6d80b0ae0224a442e1bac
#. default-sha256: c5887f05e3bdd83e0a1250afccb6b433dbcc0cbee8ed108d774ffbf113e3072f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_004E5DF0_9EA6_4EB6_858D_55E1C7416E27"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It would certainly make things easier.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(나도 그나마 편할 거야……)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D910474C_FDD5_41ED_8017_DB92FBDDF606
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e77992a9412ad5901e5fe9a3d07a8a670e5f5eba71fbfd2fd7ee95122a468f2
#. default-sha256: 14f4672e1a2f540e68b906d78eada1b4469a32e73c7534aa3c74f0ed891d2dda
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D910474C_FDD5_41ED_8017_DB92FBDDF606"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(But if I don’t... ⟪k:1⟫my imagination will run wild.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(하지만―― 안 읽으면 ⟪k:1⟫나는 멋대로 상상할 거야)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7243785E_1298_4CA5_9477_3763B0721D9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b20e38a1833a91a08a9e324c57b6a4cd7512ce084536d83b4e232d628791666f
#. default-sha256: 80a9153a90a83acd244f32b05f41176fef52cafb87de913751183cfb30ea1939
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7243785E_1298_4CA5_9477_3763B0721D9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Fantasizing about her writing to this other man... ⟪k:1⟫and what she might be putting in "
"her correspondence...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(외간 남자에게 보내는 편지를…… 그걸 쓰는 그 녀석 모습을)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C66B43D4_373A_4993_9436_ABBE96833A62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 158b662c5c167423ee7d63810eecf54db0d49ad7c399443c529aa9b8a104af5d
#. default-sha256: 4ac0f95c3f83a512f79d07d6ff9d481dfb0a06c987b5b572ab736bb967d2c94b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C66B43D4_373A_4993_9436_ABBE96833A62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I’d be better off knowing the truth than torturing myself with fantasy.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(공상에 잡아먹힐 바에는――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ 그냥 실물을 보는 게 나아)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D2D61E49_B00D_4D43_9F8B_12009474F606
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f2c21451e29d8d653fa9d5a69c0262701a3d272ddaf7aa1ce5b2a6bce463fb8
#. default-sha256: a5e72f9c07848d77f2c6e9b341510e75d24d5cd171156e838a33dc5e76504bdb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D2D61E49_B00D_4D43_9F8B_12009474F606"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It’s... ⟪k:1⟫the better option...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(그게…… 낫다고……)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6ACE457C_CCD2_4718_B71F_4C6FAFE59680
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be46ffedd2c40a1db0ae5e0e116df85b56a4c8f78b5032fa35a6cfc11047ff4f
#. default-sha256: 9d92b5360d852d3de4b3b3c4cb2b0b1af2b33edcb3a6092b2a686cf8e0e916fb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6ACE457C_CCD2_4718_B71F_4C6FAFE59680"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Jacopo accepted every letter Maria delivered, without fail."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫야코포는 ⟪k:1⟫마리아가 가져오는 편지를 마다하지 않았습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7828B9FF_F8E6_4F8F_A06F_0E3CB4F58FF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59fd94039bc469662df1137f3b509d027e9122f2673fe993f1fe9df814d24be5
#. default-sha256: d0d16e0c64e8f3914b4462b9849ad4184411fac756fa2edec1968c2b2d86c64d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7828B9FF_F8E6_4F8F_A06F_0E3CB4F58FF5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He would merely nod as he accepted it, his face contorted in discomfort, and then pore over "
"the text when he was alone."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫편지를 받을 때마다 침통한 표정으로―― ⟪k:1⟫고개를 끄덕인 후,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫혼자 있을 때 ⟪k:4⟫읽었지"
"요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_19CFD068_422C_4A7F_9260_1CE39BFEEB4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a34da507e1e58e827c18ba3b4757dd2da7847f037cff5d00eff9bce8025c38a4
#. default-sha256: 155ad42f58f5917d339b28cee7b859c8c482724aa99d1368868e7fda1340c1de
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_19CFD068_422C_4A7F_9260_1CE39BFEEB4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I assume he did not want her to see his heart sinking into darkness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫본인의 감정이 어둠에 빠지는 모습을 ⟪k:1⟫보이기 싫었을 겁니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D1D1587E_189A_45F6_8DFE_8BD627FBD823
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4f07eb6510a67305ae0521a5301550d9c679e02885bdb07d4199e58a5d2a36b
#. default-sha256: 6e68f0bf02d8471392dcc206757d6a3d5f416b6115dff7582d2f1298b7894add
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D1D1587E_189A_45F6_8DFE_8BD627FBD823"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had he put his trust in his wife rather than Maria..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만…… ⟪k:1⟫야코포가 ⟪k:2⟫마리아 말고 아내를 믿었다면."

#: scenario3:scenario3_86406C83_4B36_4C3F_8CC6_F48CAD8E8C13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5845dc9c8c22cc97a9e59b4e63eed170bfe2176a208d50f8a876a8148d20dbe9
#. default-sha256: cd7dbfa3f90141afd835d35b47c1a41d16731ff7096d64f601aca90fe6a43664
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_86406C83_4B36_4C3F_8CC6_F48CAD8E8C13"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫he would have almost certainly been able to realize the letters were directed at him, "
"despite the altered recipient name."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫보낸 이의 이름이 다르더라도, ⟪k:1⟫그 편지가 자신에게 쓴 것임을 깨달았을 겁니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_43B42520_6217_4709_AF6F_354D10551C5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b44e70c5d1c08bb74d4d9c2d602d326a9b31473f4ef01d910d5b72be053a1d8
#. default-sha256: 79662d7edd58bc4bcf8c7d84f5f80648823b84e66f0782045b237496ae3e2738
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_43B42520_6217_4709_AF6F_354D10551C5A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything she wrote about concerned him, after all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫편지에 적힌 내용은 ⟪k:1⟫모두 ⟪k:2⟫야코포와 함께한 추억이었거든요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8F118727_77C2_4DE7_80CE_8D1A5127EBD4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5cf6155cf9f0ba13a07ba984d1cd93dbec3a0b5a292b1951ca715470795af325
#. default-sha256: 6b87f2a92c8ab44db1b1e1fba41e7e62ae41f9768538071131c6e54f0935939b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8F118727_77C2_4DE7_80CE_8D1A5127EBD4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫How could someone who had lived as isolated a life as her have so many identical experiences "
"with two distinct men?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그토록 폐쇄적인 생활을 보내는 소녀가 ⟪k:1⟫다른 남자와 ⟪k:2⟫같은 과거를 공유하는 게 가능하기"
"나 할까요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_110FC6C1_9CAB_4787_A205_619E20331F8D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c29aa27a06d09f5c613fecea9f4a249ab70fc8becf582cf2b7a55b8850178cc
#. default-sha256: bea867204d439fd8349061c980d73371e3161e7bc0c13bef226e034a6d7b2320
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_110FC6C1_9CAB_4787_A205_619E20331F8D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why could he not find it in himself to trust her?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perhaps doubting her was simply "
"easier."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……왜 ⟪k:1⟫믿지를 못 하는 걸까요?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫믿는 것보다 ⟪k:4⟫의심하는 게 쉽기라도 한 걸지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_02F83CA3_4101_40CE_890F_DDC2792CE5D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1ba673330192072c9d3a31e49c28ca039f2395f7c63c2a3c3c47c0cca348bd2
#. default-sha256: 9cce337160086a2366658ff7e4871830d1101af68490ed03f1e76f9b22b7b7f0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_02F83CA3_4101_40CE_890F_DDC2792CE5D2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you were in his position... ⟪k:1⟫would you trust her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫주인님께서 같은 입장이라면…… 믿으시겠는지요?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_35F58E7B_DAE2_401E_B9CA_4E67094F114F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8dec3702bd4f363672e32666f9aae2c1365b073c64ffddf6642db56919dfc091
#. default-sha256: 8c48263aae15115d698b3131201cf1155b2bec2a2a4cafe1d51aa285fb6dfcef
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_35F58E7B_DAE2_401E_B9CA_4E67094F114F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Would you maintain faith in her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the woman who had waited so long?⟪k:3⟫Would you "
"believe the feelings she professed for you were genuine?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫오래도록 기다리는 이의 마음을……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫의심하지 않아 ⟪k:3⟫주시겠는지요?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B258CCD9_53ED_4E32_B7B4_41798DF92CF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94329fba114e063f003d70119c537e58ae6b27179397a42f5886a6550a13c2e4
#. default-sha256: 9bef972b3a935a854a2b1931af1b7a55aebac5c718f32c3d2edf43d52e319536
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B258CCD9_53ED_4E32_B7B4_41798DF92CF2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She continued writing letters—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫day after day, week after week—"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫without hiatus. ⟪k:9⟫She had, by and large, run out of things to say, but that did not "
"put an end to her letter-writing; she simply repeated what she had written before."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫편지는 끊이질 않았습니다. ⟪k:5⟫시간이 지나도 ⟪k:6⟫멈출 줄을 몰랐지요. "
"⟪k:7⟫쓸 내용이 남지도 않아 ⟪k:8⟫같은 내용을 적더라도요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_78EE2711_CC0B_4F2D_B567_91BEEAE53482
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08ede10cc282fef183c801bfe8d45d5d0ddcd3631e99c91d539581680e146ea8
#. default-sha256: 47b4e38bd0c6dacc893e0002588b832aa698f5b251b7399f357012daf77a0f9b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_78EE2711_CC0B_4F2D_B567_91BEEAE53482"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, they did not see one another in person.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The White-Haired Girl, "
"forbidden from leaving her shed,⟪k:3⟫could only wait for her husband to pay her a visit."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫둘은 결코 직접 마주하질 않았습니다. ⟪k:1⟫백발 소녀는 ⟪k:2⟫애당초 외출이 금지되었기에, ⟪k:3⟫남"
"편이 와 주길 기다릴 수밖에 없었습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8408EBA5_2745_4E66_9797_E6E12DEE1579
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4bc1a518b6b76d42e1c3d1ae6c13c1887e0ff289706faffd5cf6a6f94f1ce67
#. default-sha256: 3003b502afacdf76e581ad709facddfe1951e24ddda16bf02bebb765c73f25b3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8408EBA5_2745_4E66_9797_E6E12DEE1579"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My beloved,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There is a little bit of fog out today.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Weather like this "
"reminds me of my home country.⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사랑하는 당신. ⟪k:1⟫오늘은 ⟪k:2⟫안개가 조금 꼈어요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫고향이 떠오르는 날씨예요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EE588D42_1756_4033_BA03_96194D2307FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b3e18a8ddb13077994a15c095ce70bfdf96df5beef7db555fb3e3603f212a0d
#. default-sha256: ca14abbb2d6ee7087458f2c86b055b5ee0d445ddf506fd6fdd4956c7bb9d7d75
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE588D42_1756_4033_BA03_96194D2307FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was born on an island perpetually covered in a thick fog.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m not saying I "
"would like to return, but thinking about it does make me feel rather homesick. ⟪k:4⟫Does that "
"happen to you?⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제가 태어난 나라는 ⟪k:1⟫안개가 많은 곳이었거든요. ⟪k:2⟫돌아가고 싶단 건 아니에요. ⟪k:3⟫그래"
"도 ⟪k:4⟫고향을 떠올리면 감상적인 기분이 들진 않으시나요?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D927D0C4_01DE_4490_ADDF_462274F505D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bb38a17215eeb1377d4572f965f237daedf41ba716944c2fed0aa3f6cb54e3e
#. default-sha256: a30e1acb29f37456d31ed49206810e11c6dc8614937c1365925f759d2dbefffb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D927D0C4_01DE_4490_ADDF_462274F505D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That reminds me—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫aside from that one time, you have not told me much of your "
"homeland. ⟪k:4⟫It would be nice if we could pay it a visit together sometime.⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그러고 보니 ⟪k:1⟫당신의 고향 이야기는 ⟪k:2⟫그 후로…… 듣질 못 했네요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫언젠가 ⟪k:5⟫같"
"이 놀러 가고 싶어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A418DE7_22D7_4FF4_B384_F3B33B5554EE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd8607f406b03545f05f4eee61cab0ec038d3df69fe33ff5af580b264da4a8e0
#. default-sha256: 683b33d6754e34291012c7697526e80b22ae2dec9549f63e420e1c477dfb521a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9A418DE7_22D7_4FF4_B384_F3B33B5554EE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Speaking of which, before I left, an exhibition of some sort was held there.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫고향이 떠오른 김에 ⟪k:1⟫박람회도 생각이 났어요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫예전에 ⟪k:4⟫저희 나라에서도 열렸거든"
"요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DE47C3A5_A349_4019_A735_6CE1C9FCA621
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42abb23908b31b5532f6dacc4bddc8b9563c803eb8ffb7dbacb07a1362dda482
#. default-sha256: 81ff39297e6cd644d0727736ab3a352a3b29a9c2795b99bd93a189209ccf1e18
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DE47C3A5_A349_4019_A735_6CE1C9FCA621"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was unable to attend... ⟪k:2⟫but perhaps you had the chance when it was near you?⟪k:3⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 못 갔지만…… ⟪k:1⟫당신은 ⟪k:2⟫가 보셨나요?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1E215EC3_0314_4F72_BF79_25A39094A182
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6e4ec6640ee0a8dd77059e5230786a004deabefe16312efd56a99188bdd27c6
#. default-sha256: 26fb832434e0916081993b8308ec7799080ec366efb9a7f42ad010212764db6c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1E215EC3_0314_4F72_BF79_25A39094A182"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I imagine you would have, with your interest in new technology.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Next time you "
"have a chance, I would enjoy hearing what they had on display.⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫새로운 걸 좋아하시는 당신이잖아요. ⟪k:1⟫분명 ⟪k:2⟫가셨겠죠.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그때 어떠셨는지, ⟪k:5⟫다"
"음 기회에라도…… 알려 주세요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F8F3D491_104A_4468_AEFE_334A97CAECF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51e15f7b223b6f06ba7b123fbf1152e2cfd00139ea2511f0720c1c04c3cb08cc
#. default-sha256: 60af3e9a771a8cf73f625b4f5a429c15f2ec2bc3fd694619ade93c6429da3237
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F8F3D491_104A_4468_AEFE_334A97CAECF8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫An exhibition?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……박람회⟪k:5⟫라고……?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_70924DAF_BBEE_4C88_A858_46A061E3EAD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3e4ca53f424b142970599092eec026f1479339a7a8ffeff031c9546f5bb87ca
#. default-sha256: b652e6e2774038808465b6a65bae80ee2b25d63225558ae2b9840ab38bf25c61
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_70924DAF_BBEE_4C88_A858_46A061E3EAD6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ahh, that’s right... ⟪k:1⟫there ⟪k:2⟫was⟪k:3⟫ one..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아아――, ⟪k:1⟫그러고 보니 ⟪k:2⟫그런 것도 있었지……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2884A8E2_D32A_44C7_ADE7_DC2777D77F94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d25b6090e62ff523f8e6a5f014f4f6c24b75451f836ef0eadafc9889ceda8794
#. default-sha256: 9e3eff2e10169ed6844a4b47611ab9c65c2fe5d69e09e64c26aa80950ffacd36
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2884A8E2_D32A_44C7_ADE7_DC2777D77F94"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a year ago.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Got quite a bit of attention,⟪k:3⟫since it was supposed to have "
"been held in Paris."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그것도 1년쯤 전이었어. ⟪k:1⟫……원래는 파리에서 열리다 보니―― 많이 화제가 됐지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BDE4D010_0C7D_4C9B_8D9E_DA64DA681B03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 806630c315f36cb44747ecc65177f23f016976fd263f4532b88e1555a23b592d
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BDE4D010_0C7D_4C9B_8D9E_DA64DA681B03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_47AA4A64_709B_4E96_BFDD_E0F7A897DA37
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26b97c613923eaca3076e38b6d14a2f10d936c4a5a2e50727923c66b998f86b0
#. default-sha256: 2c5dbde7c45b3c62a6e66e243d0000197c70a940a76158a9b7679a7fc4ee139b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_47AA4A64_709B_4E96_BFDD_E0F7A897DA37"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was busy... ⟪k:1⟫preparing for our wedding.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I had no time to attend an exhibition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는…… ⟪k:1⟫너와 결혼 준비를 하느라―― 바쁘던 시기였어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫박람회를 보러 갈 여유도 없었"
"지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DD4E2548_7FAA_44ED_BE4B_A77BF4A6682B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d66a71978c5b0b7d60d2a32867ca466b773191b73fdf608208e353f70659de2b
#. default-sha256: f751b0c46315f5f618447fa9b0ba4b65b9895bded7cdee089db45930e20b2165
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DD4E2548_7FAA_44ED_BE4B_A77BF4A6682B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And while I was doing that—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫giving you, a woman I had never met before, my full "
"attention—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫너는…… 내가 그럴 때――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫아직 만나지도 못 한 너를 생각할 때……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_265B948C_8BAF_4ED4_81E5_FA434BB590B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ef5dd4a190e7202f1a556f45120db6ee7d0ebecf56051085c7419ac1819c588
#. default-sha256: 396b71c6c681cfeeb6fb6f0481a575d5e7ae0bf492a601c562d2ae37f9776c84
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_265B948C_8BAF_4ED4_81E5_FA434BB590B2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫you were giving yours to a different man?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫다른 남자 생각을 ⟪k:1⟫했어……?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E6B45EF6_C756_4058_92BD_C4E3E6B1D1AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3592e4e0533e25da5d89313e8d160de2928754d89b2c79da8cb20d2cee10abbc
#. default-sha256: a9f7a6d4a868dad73a2dbb863b691a4cad0a78dedffd9891ea9eb4caeb894d37
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E6B45EF6_C756_4058_92BD_C4E3E6B1D1AA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Has this been going on for that long?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그때부터―― 그랬단 말이야……?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_611C16A4_B71A_4B53_A9C1_33F45CBCDBDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07c2ada873a3232e300a70838415107e949d3d077094328cb3a74ea425aaa24a
#. default-sha256: 564dddf38642363ab7b027e7e05491116ff1b1d7edd8f0dca1c1536325dc7f70
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_611C16A4_B71A_4B53_A9C1_33F45CBCDBDC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫........................"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……………………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0BC53DE5_2D46_45BF_9360_BFCBD8EA10EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc1c2222ba659c77777d7a15094e6990a273d57c2f6836c1552ac38fedd1c737
#. default-sha256: edea5bf3ffcd4f301431926f8f89cf157c60eaf23e5e1d249721e9fd9da85450
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0BC53DE5_2D46_45BF_9360_BFCBD8EA10EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had he simply stepped up and taken action,⟪k:1⟫he could have put an end to the stream of "
"letters,⟪k:2⟫each of which gave rise to further misunderstanding."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫오해만이 불거지는 이런 편지도 ⟪k:1⟫야코포가 행동하면 ⟪k:2⟫해결될 문제였습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_71E4F38E_1917_4891_8C16_CC927E4DD979
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c93e43101d213bf0c4921bb4cce12b0a6227209d238129d8b4defb14c3ddf69
#. default-sha256: 21338338ec6b5c3740251052e0fc3b5c0ef9dfe33a775bed3e538792c49dfc3b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_71E4F38E_1917_4891_8C16_CC927E4DD979"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He needed merely ask the White-Haired Girl in-person to whom the letters were addressed, "
"whether what they described were true, and the twisted threads of his confusion would have all "
"been unraveled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이건 사실이야? ⟪k:1⟫누구에게 쓴 편지야? ⟪k:2⟫이렇게 백발 소녀에게 직접 물으면 ⟪k:3⟫뒤엉킨 오"
"해의 실도 풀렸겠지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B27EDCA0_0BD4_4396_80E5_F308942A3E78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ade70230e1bdcdd974155bd536490b6bc4ebbca47eb813520ef9e99c044a609f
#. default-sha256: 99a68559276959825d7f4e32aa293641eecdbbf16912bbf15caffb221bbfe82d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B27EDCA0_0BD4_4396_80E5_F308942A3E78"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But he made no such effort, relying instead on Maria to serve as his intermediary."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 야코포는 ⟪k:1⟫마리아의 중개에 의존만 하고⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫행동하려 들질 않았습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_575730D3_EF40_4CB9_A37C_1A2484F91D0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15e7ab7b07ff05747019403d092dcc48cad4f0200b74adbc93457a5feccafa2f
#. default-sha256: ed4151ab0f9021e8eec424f5d98d5e84a1068e7351f602bff24101bdbfb87fe3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_575730D3_EF40_4CB9_A37C_1A2484F91D0B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I feel as though I have now, at long last,⟪k:1⟫come to understand just what kind of man "
"Jacopo was."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫이제야 ⟪k:2⟫야코포란 인간을 알 것 같군요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_92DD5E58_656C_41CC_B352_6418C5733715
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 156e0053f9cc3f46405ff9dfc2b8f2775ae8c2fd23d6a2c5ead935c23c7da0b2
#. default-sha256: bf43b83ea3c373441f8c4238bd324f254eadbef09bbd28959fa73805fa81a0b3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_92DD5E58_656C_41CC_B352_6418C5733715"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While he had a great deal of pride in his capabilities,⟪k:1⟫he had far less confidence in "
"himself as a person."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫야코포는 매우 자존심 높은 남자였으나――, 반대로 ⟪k:1⟫자신을 평가 못 하는 인간이기도 했던 겁니"
"다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8B5731DA_FAA4_4F9A_9D09_516331D630E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01ccae0614c4fcaf3584c7e49e7e63d9a857fc35b81b99ec9dbad53f5d39d0dc
#. default-sha256: ab87742fdf9756553483c33770f845260c8244c1de184c50c21276ba5fe1d80a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8B5731DA_FAA4_4F9A_9D09_516331D630E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If he’d had faith in himself, perhaps he could have put faith in his wife as well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자신을 믿었다면 ⟪k:1⟫아내도 믿었을 겁니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_996E988B_CC27_45E8_9A67_223B48B8DA7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85ecfc6d94e30496b349e0891af7bb8e5ba57b30e940faeb01730b0c7c6faf3c
#. default-sha256: dfef79a428671cc5980f4047e79c81fc618a46ea40ee759b0d928b2577c888a7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_996E988B_CC27_45E8_9A67_223B48B8DA7D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had his pride not been so twisted, perhaps he would not have been so afraid of being hurt."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자존심이 일그러지지 않았다면 ⟪k:1⟫상심을 두려워하지 않았을 겁니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5DF31479_AE4D_47D3_9E22_F2AB4CCB1D45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58fa75a7533e766313c3037361ae08128d7024fce075280e6e4ca6243b0d1892
#. default-sha256: ad02a67ec9b77252ac2f887393701cd004c2949a22583b85412ea4429436b032
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5DF31479_AE4D_47D3_9E22_F2AB4CCB1D45"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Indeed, he was afraid. ⟪k:1⟫Afraid of being rejected by her. ⟪k:2⟫Afraid to face a reality "
"where his beloved partner scorned him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫예―― 야코포는 두려워한 겁니다. ⟪k:1⟫소녀에게 직접 부정당하는 순간을요. ⟪k:2⟫사랑하는 이가 거"
"들떠도 안 보는 현실을요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9D8604A1_08B8_4080_A485_47F651DB92D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20850ab4a5b70ec5273bc00a024486044f9a17d43e51d95d518ffc82d3e00081
#. default-sha256: 14929f383510790bfd7e4fe4e1c140245691348af2648eda16a1abd3c43e34a9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9D8604A1_08B8_4080_A485_47F651DB92D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Where the woman he loved laughed at him disdainfully. ⟪k:1⟫Where she and countless others "
"mocked him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫사랑하는 이에게 버려지고, ⟪k:1⟫비웃음을 사는 것뿐만 아니라―― 그 추태를 불특정 다수가 깔볼 거"
"라 상상한 순간,"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9990F753_29BB_42C7_B5B6_30DF42842E92
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2c90eca6c73a19549e488afd1d5b1fe4a88bb094335546029c859ca62d15acc
#. default-sha256: c4a3349e2db01ce49f83d94c783fb1931520d4032215c5d6aa1bb5fbf3bcf80d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9990F753_29BB_42C7_B5B6_30DF42842E92"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The thought of it paralyzed him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫꼼짝도 ⟪k:1⟫못 했을 겁니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AF3D5FD7_689B_4584_97BD_E11E0CA4850E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ecba8180a208bb5fe44c635aafb894fe60b442f83db0de13af19f7ebdd65184
#. default-sha256: e52ab26050b3129106f6f4b0cbf1d97983b3b917b12dd98fed8298acc815ded4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AF3D5FD7_689B_4584_97BD_E11E0CA4850E"
msgid ""
