msgid "⟪k:0⟫But listen to me, son.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You ⟪k:3⟫must not⟪k:4⟫ allow her to fool around."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만―― ⟪k:1⟫명심해라. ⟪k:2⟫여자가 방자하게 굴게 두진 마라."

#: scenario3:scenario3_380FA7EE_6339_494D_91E6_60725FCAB712
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
